{"id": "11250", "type": "the-resort", "slug": "brian-clement-farm-tour-tasting-grand-event", "path": "brian-clement-farm-tour-tasting-grand-event", "title": "Brian Clement Farm Tour and Tasting Grand Event", "date": "2026-08-26 10:09:38", "modified": "2026-09-10 16:05:16", "excerpt": "", "content": "<strong>“Awaken Your Senses” to 70 Years of Celebration in Optimum Health with World Leading Pioneers of Longevity.</strong>\r\n\r\nHippocrates Wellness: Celebrating 70 years of guiding global clients to optimum health and peak achievement through personalized wellness solutions.\r\n\r\nPerfect Foods is announcing a new <strong>in-person farm tour</strong> at our indoor farm in Goshen, NY.\r\n\r\nAfter 40+ years of growing and supplying premium wheatgrass to the Tri-State area — and two generations leading in organic farming and the wellness space — we are finally opening our doors.\r\n\r\nWe heard your requests.\r\nAnd we’re coming through.\r\n\r\nBecause honestly… it’s time.\r\n\r\nThe world is increasingly confused about wellness —\r\nwhat to put into our bodies, who to trust, what’s real and what’s not.\r\n\r\nKids are growing up with little to no connection to how food is grown or where it comes from — leaving us dependent on systems we don’t fully understand or trust.\r\n\r\nThis is our chance to change that.\r\n\r\n<strong>Join us for an interactive, hands-on experience where you’ll learn:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>How real food is actually grown</li>\r\n \t<li>The importance of living soil, quality seeds, and fresh foods</li>\r\n \t<li>How to use food as medicine in simple, practical ways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>What you’ll experience:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>A guided indoor farm tour</li>\r\n \t<li>Tastings of fresh wheatgrass juice, microgreens &amp; juices</li>\r\n \t<li>Harvest your own large microgreen salad</li>\r\n \t<li>Plant your own pot of microgreens to take home</li>\r\n \t<li>Learn how to incorporate living foods into your daily life</li>\r\n \t<li>Have a skill to bring home and learn how to grow in the future your own food</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nCome to reconnect with your food, your health, and the basics we’ve drifted away from.\r\n\r\nThis is for adults, kids, families — anyone who wants to feel more grounded in what they’re putting into their body.\r\n\r\nThe public has been asking us to do this for YEARS…\r\nand the day has finally come.\r\n\r\nWe don’t know when we’ll do this again —\r\nso if you’re thinking about it, don’t miss it.", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1.png", "terms": {"resort-category": [{"name": "Events", "slug": "events"}], "event_category": [{"name": "National Lecture Tours", "slug": "national-lecture-tours"}]}, "elementor": false, "content_live": "<div data-elementor-type=\"single-post\" data-elementor-id=\"2135\" class=\"elementor elementor-2135 elementor-location-single post-11250 the-resort type-the-resort status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry resort-category-events event_category-national-lecture-tours\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dea895c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dea895c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-116d479 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"116d479\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ddbd89 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ddbd89\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b221d05 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b221d05\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-