ement-ab49073 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ab49073\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-title.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Brian Clement Farm Tour and Tasting Grand Event</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c46f9a6 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c46f9a6\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ea025c6\" data-id=\"ea025c6\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-6bc4ab7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6bc4ab7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-5dafc2f\" data-id=\"5dafc2f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff410ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-featured-image elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ff410ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-featured-image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<img width=\"1400\" height=\"1000\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-11500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1.png 1400w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-300x214.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-1024x731.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-768x549.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1400px) 100vw, 1400px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-248cc43 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-id=\"248cc43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><strong>“Awaken Your Senses” to 70 Years of Celebration in Optimum Health with World Leading Pioneers of Longevity.</strong></p>\n<p>Hippocrates Wellness: Celebrating 70 years of guiding global clients to optimum health and peak achievement through personalized wellness solutions.</p>\n<p>Perfect Foods is announcing a new <strong>in-person farm tour</strong> at our indoor farm in Goshen, NY.</p>\n<p>After 40+ years of growing and supplying premium wheatgrass to the Tri-State area — and two generations leading in organic farming and the wellness space — we are finally opening our doors.</p>\n<p>We heard your requests.<br />\nAnd we’re coming through.</p>\n<p>Because honestly… it’s time.</p>\n<p>The world is increasingly confused about wellness —<br />\nwhat to put into our bodies, who to trust, what’s real and what’s not.</p>\n<p>Kids are growing up with little to no connection to how food is grown or where it comes from — leaving us dependent on systems we don’t fully understand or trust.</p>\n<p>This is our chance to change that.</p>\n<p><strong>Join us for an interactive, hands-on experience where you’ll learn:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>How real food is actually grown</li>\n<li>The importance of living soil, quality seeds, and fresh foods</li>\n<li>How to use food as medicine in simple, practical ways</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What you’ll experience:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A guided indoor farm tour</li>\n<li>Tastings of fresh wheatgrass juice, microgreens &amp; juices</li>\n<li>Harvest your own large microgreen salad</li>\n<li>Plant your own pot of microgreens to take home</li>\n<li>Learn how to incorporate living foods into your daily life</li>\n<li>Have a skill to bring home and learn how to grow in the future your own food</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Come to reconnect with your food, your health, and the basics we’ve drifted away from.</p>\n<p>This is for adults, kids, families — anyone who wants to feel more grounded in what they’re putting into their body.</p>\n<p>The public has been asking us to do this for YEARS…<br />\nand the day has finally come.</p>\n<p>We don’t know when we’ll do this again —<br />\nso if you’re thinking about it, don’t miss it.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01bee88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"01bee88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<a href=\"https://800wheatgrass.com/product/brian-clement-farm-tour-tasting-grand-event/\" class='rsvp_btnn'>Get tickets</a>\n<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-040f509 right_col_event\" data-id=\"040f509\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc15463 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bc15463\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-